sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant ROUTE as GET /reports/{vehicle_id}
    participant RPT as report_service.py
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FE2 as MaintenanceReportView

    FE->>ROUTE: request report for SIM-001
    ROUTE->>RPT: generate_report("SIM-001")
    RPT->>DB: SELECT last N predictions<br/>WHERE vehicle_id = "SIM-001"<br/>ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    DB-->>RPT: prediction history + alerts
    
    Note over RPT: Aggregate:<br/>- avg health score trend<br/>- top recurring failure risks<br/>- sensors with worst contributions<br/>- unresolved alerts

    RPT-->>ROUTE: MaintenanceReport
    ROUTE-->>FE: JSON response
    FE->>FE2: render report
